---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <div class="footer-logo">KPOP<span>LIVES</span></div>
      <p class="footer-desc lang-en">
        Independent K-Pop newsroom & English cultural criticism. Available in English, Korean, Japanese, and Spanish.
      </p>
      <p class="footer-desc lang-ko">
        글로벌 팬들을 위한 K-POP 뉴스룸 & 영문 문화 비평 칼럼 블로그. 영어·한국어·일본어·스페인어 번역을 지원합니다.
      </p>
      <p class="footer-desc lang-jp">
        グローバルファンのためのK-POPニュース＆英語カルチャーコラム。英語・韓国語・日本語・スペイン語に対応しています。
      </p>
      <p class="footer-desc lang-es">
        Noticias independientes de K-Pop y columnas culturales en inglés, con soporte en coreano, japonés y español.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-links">
      <a href="/news">
        <span class="lang-en">News</span>
        <span class="lang-ko">뉴스</span>
        <span class="lang-jp">ニュース</span>
        <span class="lang-es">Noticias</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/columns">
        <span class="lang-en">English Columns</span>
        <span class="lang-ko">영문 칼럼</span>
        <span class="lang-jp">コラム</span>
        <span class="lang-es">Columnas</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/about">
        <span class="lang-en">Publishing Guide</span>
        <span class="lang-ko">글 작성 가이드</span>
        <span class="lang-jp">投稿ガイド</span>
        <span class="lang-es">Guía editorial</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container footer-bottom">
    <span>© {year} KPOP LIVES. All rights reserved.</span>
    <span class="footer-tech">Powered by Astro & Markdown</span>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    margin-top: 96px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    background: rgba(11, 11, 18, 0.85);
    padding: 52px 0 32px;
  }

  .footer-inner {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 32px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding-bottom: 36px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .footer-logo {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .footer-logo span {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent-pink), var(--accent-cyan));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .footer-desc {
    max-width: 440px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 22px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .footer-links a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    padding-top: 22px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
</style>
